==May (5) 2026==

===2026 Q2 Update (26/5/2026)===

'''Experience removed & King level'''
*{{Balance|Remove}} [[Experience]] is being removed.
*{{Balance|Neutral}}Unlock will be at the [[Arenas|trophy road]]:
**[[Clans|Clan]] unlock at arena 1 (from level 1)
**Deck Slots unlock at arena 1 (from level 2)
**Clan Donation unlock at arena 2 (from level 3)
**[[Pass Royale]] unlock at arena 2 (from level 7)
**[[Clan Wars]] unlock at arena 3 (from level 10)
**Clan Trading unlock at arena 3 (from level 16)
**[[Card Mastery]] unlock at arena 4 (from level 14)
**[[Star Points]] unlock at arena 5 (from level 9)
*{{Balance|Neutral}}[[King's Tower|King level]] updrage is being changed from level to having a centain amount of card at a certain card level.

'''King's Journey removed & collection level'''
*{{Balance|Remove}} The kings journey is being removed
**{{Balance|Neutral}} All unclaimed rewards will be autocollected
*{{Balance|Add}} [[Collection Level]] is a new way to earn rewards
*Uprade cards, and unlock [[heroes]] and [[Card Evolution|evolutions]], to progress through the collection levels to earn reward
*The collection level=levels of every card you own & +5 for every evo and hero form you own.
*{{Balance|Add}} When the update comes out, you will get rewards depending on where you will be

'''Mastery changes'''
*{{Balance|Buff}} All [[Card Mastery|mastery]] task will be much easier to complete
**Because of this, some numbers in this wiki will be higher than what you actually need
*{{Balance|Neutral}} All rewards are changed to only gold (giving 4.000, 6.000 and 15.000 respectfully)

'''Seasonal Arena'''
*{{Balance|Add}} After 14,000 trophies, you unlock seasonal arenas
*The first arena is normal. Unlock 500 trophies to get to arena two
*Arena two will have the 8 cards you played the most banned. Get a badge afer getting 500 trophies.
*{{Balance|Buff}} All cards in arena 2 are bosted to level 15

'''Victory Run'''
*{{Balance|Add}} Victory run is a event on the home screen.
*Win games to climb up and get rewards
*You have 3 lives (4 with pass royale). Loss all your lives, and you can spend 10 gems, or fall down.
*There will be checkpoints. But the distance will be further, the higher you are.

'''Princess Gambit'''
*{{Balance|Add}} Princess Gambit is a new game mode comming to the game
*It has a total of 40 cards (6 Spells, 4 Win Conditions, 4 Heavy Cards, 2 Buildings and 24 Support Cards).
*There is no decks. You just get the 40 cards in your hand at random
*The start of the match will show the active evolutions and heroes. Evolutions has 0 cycles
*There is no king tower, and its all in Sudden Death

'''Other Changes'''
*{{Balance|Add}} if you stop playing for a while, the daily rewards will be better
*{{Balance|Add}} You can now spectate Global Tournaments
*{{Balance|Add}} You can now favourite [[Battle Banners]]. This is the same as emotes, as they will appear at the top.
*{{Balance|Add}} You can now skip tiers in [[Pass Royale|pass royale]]. 10gems per crown
*{{Balance|Add}} If you buy Pass Royale multiple times in a row, you may gain a bonus reward
**Do note that this is in testing, and not necessarily be available for all players.
*{{Balance|Add}} Mini Pass is being added to the game. Its like pass royale, but cheaper, shorter and less rewards. Free to play can still get some rewards.
**Do note that this is in testing, and not necessarily be available for all players.
